  "licensing": {
    "sourceIsRealCompany": true,
    "summary": "This repo encodes structure and contracts only. It ships no logos, photos, brand files or page-length text (the only source text it holds is short blocklist fragments, real names and URLs in assets/asset-roles.json `sourceBrand.patterns`, there so a generated page can be checked against them), and its asset-role contract forbids a generator from reproducing real customer logos, real people's photos or likenesses, real testimonials, Conductor's trademarks, or Conductor's proprietary docs/changelog text, and from reusing the live HubSpot/Google Form endpoints or the vendor download CDN. Treat the repo as private until the owner has reviewed it; nothing here grants any licence to the source company's marks or content. PageSpec `mode` separates documenting the source (`reference`) from composing a page for another brand (`generated`): generated pages may not carry the Conductor / Melty name, its CTA text, marketing, testimonial, changelog or docs copy, its URLs or endpoints, or any reference-only or blocked asset role (assets/asset-roles.json `availability`, `sourceBrand.patterns`). The sourceBrand patterns were derived by a model from src/ and have not been reviewed by a human."
  },
